@startuml

title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Model Retraining Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>Online Learning and Model Update Flow</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


participant "Streamlit\nDashboard" as UI #EDE9FE
participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE
participant "OnlineTrainer" as Trainer #FEF3C7
participant "StutterTransferClassifier" as Model #DDD6FE
database "Model Weights\nstutter_model.pt" as Weights #ECFDF5
participant "FluencyPredictor" as Predictor #C4B5FD


== Feedback Collection ==

UI -> API : Submit feedback sample
API -> Trainer : addFeedbackSample(...)
Trainer --> API : Feedback queued


== Model Retraining ==

UI -> API : Request model retraining
API -> Trainer : trainOnlineStep()

Trainer -> Model : Train on feedback samples
Model --> Trainer : Updated model

Trainer -> Weights : Save updated weights
Weights --> Trainer : Saved successfully

Trainer --> API : Training complete


== Activate Updated Model ==

API -> Predictor : reloadWeights()
Predictor -> Weights : Load updated weights
Weights --> Predictor : New model weights
Predictor --> API : Model ready

API --> UI : Retraining complete

@enduml